 "notes": [
  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (5): Yavin 4: Massassi Throne Room, Insurrection, Staging Areas, Your Insight Serves You Well, Heading For The Medical Frigate; these count toward the 60. Three Effects start, none named as the starting Effect, so starting.effect is left empty.",
  "Insurrection, Staging Areas and Your Insight Serves You Well are posted as separate cards (the strategy says Aim High was left out and speaks of ditching Insight), so the single printings are used, not the combos.",
  "Posted 'Mess/Proficiency' dested Sorry About The Mess & Blaster Proficiency; 'Ben w/Stick' dested Obi-Wan With Lightsaber (counted in Dudes (19); no Obi-Wan's Lightsaber is listed); 'Weapon Levitation' dested the Light Jabba's Palace interrupt; 'Hoth Docking Bay' dested Hoth: Echo Docking Bay; 'Hoth War Room' dested Hoth: Echo Command Center (War Room); 'Honor' dested Honor Of The Jedi.",
  "The strategy says this is the deck taken to the Victorian State Championships (Australia), undefeated, with one change: Major Haash'n was played in place of the Alter. No other list from that event by this author.",
  "The post notes the deck was built and played before Tatooine."
 ],
